+ IS=1.0213e-10     RS=6.8230e-1     NR=2.0
+ N=1.5                  ISR=1.55e-8        CJO=1.15e-12
+ VJ=0.58               M=0.021              FC=0.5
+ BV=85                IBV=5.0e-6          TT=6.0835e-9
+ EG=1.11
**----------------------------------------------
** Creation: Jul.-15-2009   Rev: 0.0
** Fairchild Semiconductor


