*INPUT IMPEDANCE VS FREQUENCY 
*OUTPUT IMPEDANCE VS OUTPUT CURRENT
*INPUT VOLTAGE NOISE VS FREQUENCY
*INPUT CURRENT NOISE VS FREQUENCY 
*OUTPUT VOLTAGE SWING VS OUTPUT CURRENT
