* 

* =====================================================================
* LTspice-ROBUST EQUIVALENTS  (use these in the schematic: INA149G, TLE2141G)
* Why: TI's INA149/TLE2141 macromodels use PSpice VSWITCH elements. LTspice
* runs those in a slow PSpice-compatibility mode; in this bootstrapped circuit
* LTspice either latched (V+ = V-, 121 mA through U2) or failed to converge.
* These equivalents keep TI's exact INA149 resistor network and replace only
* the op-amp cores with a switch-free model set to datasheet values:
*   [DS] = TI datasheet value,  [FIT] = tuned so the closed-loop part matches [DS]
* Not modelled: input offset/bias, noise, CMRR/PSRR, short-circuit limit.
* The original TI models stay above (INA149, TLE2141) for A/B comparison.
* =====================================================================
*
* Generic op-amp core: single pole, slew limit, output clamped to the rails,
* supply current that returns load current through V+ (sourcing) or V- (sinking).
.subckt OPAGEN INP INN VP VN OUT params: GBW=1Meg SR=1Meg IQ=1m VSWH=1.5 VSWL=1.5 AOL=1Meg
.param Ccomp=1n
Rin INP INN 10Meg
Bmid mid 0 V=(V(VP)+V(VN))/2
B1 mid n1 I=limit({6.2832*GBW*Ccomp}*(V(INP)-V(INN)), {-SR*Ccomp}, {SR*Ccomp})
Cc n1 mid {Ccomp}
Rg n1 mid {AOL/(6.2832*GBW*Ccomp)}
Bhi hi 0 V=V(VP)-{VSWH}
Blo lo 0 V=V(VN)+{VSWL}
Dh n1 hi DCLMP
Dl lo n1 DCLMP
Bo outi 0 V=limit(V(n1), V(lo), V(hi))
Vs outi o2 0
Ro o2 OUT 1
Bq VP VN I={IQ}*tanh(V(VP,VN)/0.5)
Bsrc VP 0 I=max(I(Vs),0)
Bsnk 0 VN I=max(-I(Vs),0)
.model DCLMP D(Is=1e-14 N=1)
.ends OPAGEN
*
* INA149G  pins: +IN -IN REF_A REF_B V+ V- VOUT  (same order as TI INA149)
*   resistor network copied from TI's INA149 subckt [DS]
*   BW 500 kHz [DS] -> core GBW 10.5 MHz [FIT, noise gain 21]; SR 5 V/us [DS];
*   Iq 0.81 mA [DS]; swing 1.5 V from each rail at 2k [DS]
.subckt INA149G +IN -IN REF_A REF_B V+ V- VOUT
R1   8 VOUT 380k
R2   -IN 8 380k
R3   +IN 9 380k
RREFA 9 REF_A 19k
RREFB REF_B 8 20k
XOP  9 8 V+ V- VOUT OPAGEN params: GBW=10.5Meg SR=5Meg IQ=0.81m VSWH=1.5 VSWL=1.5 AOL=1Meg
.ends INA149G
*
* TLE2141G  pins: IN+ IN- VCC VEE OUT  (same order as TI TLE2141)
*   GBW 5.9 MHz [DS]; SR 45 V/us [DS]; Icc 3.5 mA [DS];
*   swing: 1.0 V below VCC, 0.2 V above VEE at ~1.5 mA [DS]
.subckt TLE2141G IN+ IN- VCC VEE OUT
XOP IN+ IN- VCC VEE OUT OPAGEN params: GBW=5.9Meg SR=45Meg IQ=3.5m VSWH=1.0 VSWL=0.2 AOL=1Meg
.ends TLE2141G
